WoWFA_Data[385633] = "Concentration Aura، Devotion Aura و Crusader Aura را یاد می‌گیرید:\n\nConcentration Aura:\nInterrupt and Silence effects on party and raid members within 40 yds are 30% shorter. $?a339124[Fear effects are also reduced.][]\n\n Devotion Aura:\nParty and raid members within 40 yds are bolstered by their devotion, reducing damage taken by 3%.\n\n Crusader Aura:\nIncreases mounted speed by 20% for all party and raid members within 40 yds."
